OL,3,GNEWSAGarden bin fee makes #620k more
OL,4,Athan expected
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe introduction of a fees for garden
OL,7,Fwaste bin collections fee has generated
OL,8,F#620,000 more than a local authority
OL,9,Fhad expected.
OL,11,FWestmorland and Furness Council
OL,12,Fintroduced the #60 charge on 1 April.
OL,13,FIn the scheme's first six months, about
OL,14,F42,000 subscriptions were bought which
OL,15,Famounted to some 10,000 more than
OL,16,Fexpected.
OL,18,FThese extra purchases meant income from
OL,19,Fthe scheme stood at #2.5m and was 32%
OL,20,Fhigher than expected.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
